  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle.\n• Finely chop brown onion and garlic.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-675124d0deb6306cae776622-23825f46.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook onions and sliced mushrooms, stirring, until browned and softened, 6-8 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-675124d0deb6306cae776622-fa8b61e8.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, half-fill a large saucepan with boiling water, then add a generous pinch of salt.\n• Cook gnocchi in boiling water until floating on the surface, 2-3 minutes.\n• Reserve some pasta water (1/2 cup for 2 people / 1 cup for 4 people), if needed. Drain gnocchi, then return to saucepan. Drizzle with olive oil, if needed.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-675124d0deb6306cae776622-393cf2e5.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• To the pan with the veggies, reduce heat to low. Add garlic & herb seasoning and garlic and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Add thickened cream, a good pinch of salt, Parmesan cheese (reserve some for garnish!) and baby spinach leaves. Cook, stirring, until heated through, 1-2 minutes.\n• Add cooked gnocchi, stir to combine, then remove from heat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-675124d0deb6306cae776622-ac3c3b33.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Roughly chop tomato.\n• In a medium bowl, combine a drizzle of balsamic vinegar and olive oil. Season to taste, then add rocket leaves and tomato. Toss to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-675124d0deb6306cae776622-18405937.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide creamy mushroom and Parmesan gnocchi between bowls.\n• Sprinkle with the reserved Parmesan.\n• Serve with rocket and tomato salad. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-675124d0deb6306cae776622-88ac35a5.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
